# A Control and an NFR disagree: the Control is applied and the conflict is recorded; an edit that breaks the Control is refused.
id: codify-controls-conflict
skill: highway-codify
fixture: codify-controls-nfrs
open: /highway-codify Northwind Restock Alerts Send the weekly restock alert
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [edit] Send it by email instead.
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Fine, keep it as it is.
ask: Would you like to:
say: [decline] Stop here.
writes: code/**
expect: contains code/*/.highway/features/001-*/codify.md :: Restock Alerts Use Team Chat
expect: contains code/*/.highway/features/001-*/codify.md :: Restock Alert Email Delivery disagrees.
reaches: govern
reaches: revise
